Rush Hour 2 is a 2001 American buddy cop action comedy film
directed by Brett Ratner and written by Jeff Nathanson.

16
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:26,000
A sequel to Rush Hour (1998), it is the second installment in the Rush Hour franchise and
stars Jackie Chan and Chris Tucker reprising their roles from the first film.

17
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
The story follows Hong Kong Police Force (HKPF) Chief Inspector Lee (Chan) and Los Angeles Police Department (LAPD) Detective
James Carter (Tucker), who go to Hong Kong on vacation only to be thwarted by a murder case involving two U.S.

